5,1,1,talk,Mio,,We need to fix the fee structure. I’m worried we’re guessing again. What data should we check first?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to understand why some members hesitate to commit. What records show their attendance patterns?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to see who actually shows up versus who just pays. Let’s check the sign-in sheets and the rota.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to know the true cost of the treasurer role. I’ll check the outgoing treasurer’s logged hours and the ledger.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m curious about why people don’t join after tasting it. I’ll check the taster forms and the mid-year sign-ups.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, that sounds heavy. Do you think the hours will tell us if we can actually afford to keep the job?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, the hesitation isn’t about money, it’s about commitment. I’ll look into the weekday turnout and the winter social feedback.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, it’s not just commitment, it’s fairness. If the same nine people do everything, why should they pay the same as the ghosts?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, fairness matters, but I need to know if the current system is even sustainable before we debate who pays more.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, I get that, but I’m worried about how visible any change will be. I’ll check the taster forms and mid-year sign-ups to see how newcomers feel.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Jonathan, I’m glad you’re looking at the turnout. I’m going to check the bank statements and the ledger to see exactly where our money is going.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, the bank statements might show if people are struggling to pay upfront. I’ll check the renewals and the winter social notes.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, the ledger is just numbers. I need the sign-in sheets and the rota to prove who is actually doing the work.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, the ledger shows fixed costs, but the hours show the labor. I’ll check the treasurer’s log and the ledger to see the true burden.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mio, I’m checking the taster forms and mid-year sign-ups to see why people hesitate to commit fully.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
