35,2,1,talk,Mio,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Mio**: The ledger is brutal. Seventy percent of our money vanishes into fixed costs, whether anyone shows up or not.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"- **Jonathan**: The turnout data is alarming. Since the summer door charges, weekday attendance dropped by a third and never recovered.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Jonathan, that drop is terrifying. If people stopped feeling those evenings were theirs, a flat fee might feel like a punishment.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: @Mio, exactly. The winter social notes confirm it. Quiet members feel uneasy about the cost per visit. We must protect that sense of belonging.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"- **Takumi**: @Mio, @Jonathan, the sign-in sheets prove it. A quarter of us do two-thirds of the work. Eighteen people never show up.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"- **Toshio**: @Takumi, the labor data is worse. Chasing individual payments took six hours monthly. A yearly collection took barely one.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"- **Kenji**: @Mio, @Jonathan, the taster forms are heartbreaking. Nine out of fourteen said they wouldn’t take on a whole year at once.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Toshio, six hours a month chasing money? That’s why the job gets abandoned. We can’t keep doing that.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: @Toshio, that confirms it. The hesitation isn’t about the price, it’s about the friction. We need a system that doesn’t demand constant chasing.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"- **Takumi**: @Toshio, that explains the burnout. But the rota shows the same nine people doing the setup. We need to fix the labor, not just the billing.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the labor is the problem. If we stop chasing individual payments, the role becomes manageable. We must fix the collection method first.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mio, @Jonathan, the taster forms show people fear the whole-year commitment. If we make the entry point smaller, we might stop the bleeding.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Kenji, that fear of the whole year is exactly why I’m nervous about a flat fee. We need a way in that doesn’t feel like a trap.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, I agree. The winter social notes show quiet members are already anxious. We need a structure that feels safe, not like a sudden bill.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, @Jonathan, I hear you, but the sign-in sheets show eighteen ghosts. If we make it too easy, the core nine carry everything.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the core nine are already overburdened. Adding complexity to their workload will break the system. We need simplicity to save the treasurer role.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, I hear you, but the taster forms show people need a smaller step. If we make the entry point less scary, maybe they’ll actually stay and help.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
